<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.04		 3.84</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.11		 6.50</p>
<p>  Growth Funds			    1.01		38.88</p>
<p>* Prices include distributed dividends</p>
<p>VOLUME OF SHARES</p>
